{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability","title":"Social Emotional Stability","description":"Kemampuan mengelola emosi agar tidak menjadi reaksi defensif atau destruktif.","tags":["psychology","emotional-regulation","maturity"],"custom":{"description":"Kemampuan mengelola emosi agar tidak menjadi reaksi defensif atau destruktif."},"fname":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"3a77849c5f468d7ccc58b79476bdd6bb","updated":1782198659099,"created":1782198659099,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability","id":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.psychology","alias":"psychology","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.psychology"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability","id":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.emotional-regulation","alias":"emotional-regulation","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.emotional-regulation"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability","id":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.maturity","alias":"maturity","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.maturity"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability","id":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":11,"offset":839},"end":{"line":16,"column":58,"offset":886},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism","id":"notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":51,"offset":1508},"end":{"line":22,"column":98,"offset":1555},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.social-emotional-stability"}],"anchors":{"social-emotional-stability":{"type":"header","text":"Social Emotional Stability","value":"social-emotional-stability","line":13,"column":0,"depth":1},"definition":{"type":"header","text":"Definition","value":"definition","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"application-in-narcissistic-patterns":{"type":"header","text":"Application in Narcissistic Patterns","value":"application-in-narcissistic-patterns","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"social-emotional-stability\">Social Emotional Stability<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#social-emotional-stability\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"social-emotional-stability-1\">Social Emotional Stability<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#social-emotional-stability-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"definition\">Definition<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#definition\"></a></h2>\n<p>Stabilitas emosional sosial bukan berarti tidak memiliki emosi, melainkan kemampuan memastikan bahwa emosi tidak langsung berubah menjadi kekerasan, hinaan, <em>silent treatment</em>, atau drama.</p>\n<h2 id=\"application-in-narcissistic-patterns\">Application in Narcissistic Patterns<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#application-in-narcissistic-patterns\"></a></h2>\n<p>Bagi individu dengan pola narsistik (terutama neurotik), stabilitas emosional sangat krusial karena rasa malu (<em>shame</em>) sangat mudah berubah menjadi reaksi defensif.</p>\n<p><strong>Contoh Pergeseran Respons:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Tanpa Stabilitas</strong>: Rasa sakit <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Iri <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Menarik diri <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Narasi \"Gue selalu tenggelam\".</li>\n<li><strong>Dengan Stabilitas</strong>: Rasa sakit <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Analisis Fakta <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Koreksi Strategi <span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span> Aksi (misal: mendokumentasikan ide).</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Atomic Idea</strong>: Emosi boleh muncul; yang perlu dilatih adalah jalur keluarnya.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism\">Social Maturity and Narcissism Reduction</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">emotional-regulation (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">maturity (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.social-maturity-narcissism\">Social Maturity and Narcissism Reduction</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","f